    if ask == 'if_the_wicked_deserves_beating':
        ink('25:2', "'then if THE WICKED DESERVES BEATING (a son of beating), the judge shall make him lie down AND STRIKE HIM BEFORE HIM BY NUMBER according to his wickedness' — 'a son of beating' the floggable class; 'by number' the count's word; 25:3 shares %d token with Leviticus 19:20 (the maidservant's lashing — the restatements that share no words)" % (TWIN['25:3 vs Lev 19:20'],))
